 - eap-gtc (EAP-GTC protocol handler authenticating with XAuth backends)
 - eap-identity (EAP-Identity identity exchange algorithm, to use with other
 EAP protocols)
 - eap-md5 (EAP-MD5 protocol handler using passwords)
